 {
  "name": "A loss partly replaced within the period is denied in proportion and added to the new units' cost",
  "spec": "SPEC.md tax-cost-of-an-etf-7; adjustedcostbase.ca, Applying the superficial loss rule for a partial disposition of shares, Example 1",
  "working": [
