   "Loss = 200 - 300 = -100. Period 2015-03-15 to 2015-05-14: bought in it P = 25, held at its end B = 25, sold S = 100: denied = 100 x min(100, 25, 25) / 100 = 25.00; allowed loss 75.00.",
   "The 25.00 goes on the holding's cost the day of the sale (no units then), the 25 units bring 55.00: cost 80.00 on 25 units, as the example's $80.00."
